    narrative: Optional[str]
    """Legacy per-bet narrative sentence generated alongside the validator pass. Legacy sports only."""
    rationale: List[str]
    """Legacy human-readable rationale bullets built from `signals`. Legacy sports only."""
    attribution: List[str]
    """Attribution keys backing `rationale`, in the same order. Legacy sports only."""
    probability: Optional[float]
    """Published probability for this outcome, 0-1. Equals `p_market` (the de-vigged market price) whenever `blend_w` is 0, which is the case for every league that does not yet have a fitted model that beat the market out-of-sample; otherwise it is the log-space blend of `p_model` and `p_market` at weight `blend_w`. Outcomes of the same market (e.g. ML_HOME + ML_DRAW + ML_AWAY) are blended jointly and sum to 1. Predictive-framework sports only."""
